<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Register • Sambhav Security Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="badge">🛡️ Weak Authentication Training</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/login">Login</a>
                <a href="/blackbox">Black Box</a>
                <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <section class="form-card">
            <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">📝 Register</h1>
            <p>Create a test account to explore identification & authentication failures.</p>

            <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <div class="alert error"><%= error %></div>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/register" method="POST" class="grid">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="username">Username</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="neo" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="neo@matrix.io" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="123456" required>
                    <small style="color: rgba(15, 44, 92, 0.7);">Passwords are stored in plain text to highlight OWASP A02 risks.</small>
                </div>
                <button class="btn" type="submit">Create Account</button>
            </form>

            <p class="form-footnote">Already have credentials? <a href="/login">Login instead</a></p>
        </section>

        <section class="alert" style="margin-top:32px;">
            <h3>🎯 CTF Hint</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:18px;">
                <li>Reuse weak passwords and brute-force easily.</li>
                <li>No rate limiting or email verification is enforced.</li>
                <li>Usernames and emails are only superficially validated.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Use these weaknesses to craft attacks and pivot into other OWASP challenge areas.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
